# No env vars are required. The widget renders a public booking page, so the
# starter works read-only out of the box against the demo workspace.
#
# To point the homepage at your own booking page instead, set both of these
# (your booking URL is https://buildoutschedule.com/{workspace}/{event-type}),
# or edit the fallbacks in src/lib/config.ts:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SCHEDULE_WORKSPACE=your-workspace
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SCHEDULE_EVENT_TYPE=your-event-type
